Origin and modification notice
------------------------------

GreeComfort is a modified version of HomeAssistant-GreeClimateComponent
(https://github.com/RobHofmann/HomeAssistant-GreeClimateComponent) by Rob Hofmann and
its contributors, forked at release 3.3.2 and licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3. As that license requires, this notice states that the work has been
modified.

Modified from 2026-02-20 onward, including: a separate `gree_comfort` domain; comfort
presets with separate heat and cool temperatures; manual override tracking; smart 8°C
frost protection; Eco Shutoff; native °C units with Home Assistant conversion; hvac_action
inferred from the unit's own temperature sensor; and a pytest suite. The git history
records every change and its date.
